  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN Summit in Manila hosted various international leaders, including President Prabowo Subianto and former President Donald Trump, for a series of high-level diplomatic meetings. During the proceedings, President Prabowo advocated for regional stability and addressed global concerns, including the push for Palestinian sovereignty during the 21st East Asia Summit. His contributions focused on strengthening transnational crime coordination and expanding renewable energy, specifically citing a plan for a 100-gigawatt solar energy capacity. The summit also served as a venue for bilateral engagements, such as meetings between regional leaders and the ASEAN-United States partnership discussions. As the event concluded, Singapore was formally announced as the next chair for 2027. Demonstrations were also noted in the vicinity of the summit venue during the arrival of international delegations.",
